{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>save the World In the Blink Of An Eye!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/c6c8bf4b317b67b504dc638d7b045962.poster.avif?t=1763230432\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/c6c8bf4b317b67b504dc638d7b045962.webm?t=1763230432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/c6c8bf4b317b67b504dc638d7b045962.mp4?t=1763230432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Project Cradle is a momentum-based platformer. Play as HelperBody, a robotic kangaroo with a penchant for speed. Use your speed and abilities to maintain a complex network of underground facilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earn Your Speed!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/f202301e62da7e5bc6564510171df2ff.poster.avif?t=1763230432\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/f202301e62da7e5bc6564510171df2ff.webm?t=1763230432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/f202301e62da7e5bc6564510171df2ff.mp4?t=1763230432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>HelperBody can build ridiculous levels of speed by using momentum! Land on a slope just right to gain a large boost, then jump while zooming up a hill to launch yourself high into the air! Bounce off a spring or launcher to go even faster still! Ride back and forth on a half-pipe to build up momentum!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Off The Walls!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/759d2a0849ff40dcc82ffa76128e4108.poster.avif?t=1763230432\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/759d2a0849ff40dcc82ffa76128e4108.webm?t=1763230432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/759d2a0849ff40dcc82ffa76128e4108.mp4?t=1763230432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your little robo roo can ride up walls, then wall jump off of them! Great for getting up those tight spaces!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speed Is Sanctuary!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/d28dd5e094ce8250f2d4d9a459ba554a.poster.avif?t=1763230432\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/d28dd5e094ce8250f2d4d9a459ba554a.webm?t=1763230432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/d28dd5e094ce8250f2d4d9a459ba554a.mp4?t=1763230432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>For Project Cradle, speed is the name of the game. Move at high velocity to generate a protective shield that deflects enemy attacks! Perform high flying feats by jumping while running up slopes!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2757950?t=1763230432","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2757950?t=1763230432","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/7ccd90a8ae4450d7a826996e1a0ec5b0b5ef636f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763230432","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.st